The upstream license is reproduced in LICENSE-SPIRV-Headers. Changes: selected
only the current embedded compute shader instruction envelope, converted opcode
numbers and operand positions/counts into Go metadata. Other opcodes are rejected.
The contract inspector is Go-owned metadata admission, not SPIRV-Tools validation.
